(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/24/code.py:467:        _stamp_recolored(out, patch_s, color, color, target_anchors[key][0], target_anchors[key][1])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/25/code.py:30:#      If a later horizontal T uses A as its source side, phase 2 recolors (A union B),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/25/code.py:31:#      whereas a simultaneous solver would recolor only A.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/25/code.py:511:    Read orientation-coded T markers, run a reversed two-phase recolor, and optionally rotate the result with a color-9 L marker.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/25/code.py:521:    - Phase 1 applies all vertical Ts simultaneously: each source-side region is recolored to the pointed-at target region's original color, while the target itself stays unchanged.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/25/code.py:522:    - Phase 2 then applies all horizontal Ts on the already modified grid: each source-side region is recolored to the original color of the unique third region touching that T, while the pointed-at target again stays unchanged.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/1ae2feb7/D8/3/code.py:75:#   arithmetic period (a common step derived from multiple marks) without adding extra\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:3:# Change: 2-7种非背景色，箭头和墙壁各自单色，射线颜色随反射继承墙壁色... → 箭头颜色编码反射规则\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:7:# - 保留原题的像素对象: 3 像素 L 形箭头、1/3 像素直墙、45 度对角线射线、撞墙后继承墙色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:9:#   blue=1 的箭头只响应竖直墙, 只翻转 dc;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:10:#   red=2 的箭头只响应水平墙, 只翻转 dr.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:14:#   变体: 若箭头是 red, 只看 (r+dr,c), 忽略 (r,c+dc); 若箭头是 blue, 则反过来。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:15:#   因此同样的“双邻墙”视觉结构, 不同箭头颜色会产生不同折返方向和不同继承颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:18:# - 只使用两种箭头色 {1,2}, 映射到两类规则 {vertical-only, horizontal-only}。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:20:# - 墙颜色仍来自独立调色板 {3..9} 的一个子集, 保留颜色继承这一原题机制, 但避免与箭头色混淆。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:26:#   这依赖“所有箭头共享同一反射规则”。变体下该前提失效, 必须先由箭头颜色选定允许翻转的轴。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:28:#   这一点在变体中仍成立, 但只能对“该箭头允许的那类反射”执行; 对被忽略的邻墙不能继承颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:29:# - 原代码逐色找 3 像素 L 形连通块作为箭头。变体仍可用, 但生成器必须避免墙使用箭头颜色,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:33:# - 生成器沿用 output-first: 先规划每个箭头的真实路径, 再放箭头和墙, 最后用新 solver 校验。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:36:# - 每个墙段都与所属 bounce cell 邻接, 且不与箭头、射线或先前墙段重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:39:# - 每个样例至少同时包含一支 red 箭头和一支 blue 箭头。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:40:# - 每支箭头至少有 1 次 bounce, 且第一次 bounce 强制放置“双邻墙”:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:43:#   红箭头遇到同样的双邻墙时沿“水平反射”规则折返,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:44:#   蓝箭头则沿“垂直反射”规则折返。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:47:# - 墙色与箭头色分离, 箭头只用两色, 视觉角色清楚。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:49:# - 箭头数量控制在 2-6, 网格仍为 18-20, 防止拥挤和歧义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:52:# - 箭头色只承担“选规则”这一种语义, 墙色只承担“被继承的轨迹颜色”这一种语义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:53:# - 因为墙色来自独立集合, 看到输出时可以把“方向变化”归因于箭头色, 把“射线换色”归因于墙色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:61:# - main() 现在假设“真正的箭头颜色只会是 1 或 2”。生成器通过固定箭头调色板保证这一点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:62:# - main() 假设墙不会与箭头同色从而造成角色歧义。生成器通过墙色只取 {3..9} 保证这一点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:63:# - main() 假设至少存在可识别的 3 像素 L 形箭头, 且双邻墙不会压到未来轨迹上。生成器在构造阶段显式检查。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D16/0/code.py:74:    1: \"dc\",  # blue arrow: onl