8:      再例如 5 像素箭头遇到四面侧墙：前两面仍按原题反射，后两面开始被忽略，路径从第二次反射后改为一条直线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:31:      只保留三档额度，避免把“箭头形状→额度”的映射做得过细；同时每支箭都会至少遇到 1 个超额墙，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:35:      - 原 solver 的 is_arrow_pts 假设箭头恒为 3 像素 2x2 L；变体中不成立，必须改为显式匹配 3/4/5 像素尾巴家族。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:36:      - 原 solver 看到侧墙就无条件反射；变体中必须改为有额度门控，否则 3 像素箭头会被误判为还能反射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:40:      - 4 像素箭头允许把额外像素放在任一臂上，但 solver 只依据像素总数解码额度，不依赖是哪一条臂更长。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:43:      生成器对每支箭独立回溯规划完整输出路径，确保箭头、墙、射线三者不重叠、不越界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:44:      墙色避开相邻同色对象，降低同色连通块意外合并成“假箭头”或“大墙”的风险。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:47:      同一张图中通常会混有不同大小的箭头，且每支箭都会把自己的额度用满并再经过 1-2 个无效侧墙。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:48:      因此人眼能看到：小箭头更早停止转向/变色，大箭头能多反一次，再之后所有墙都只留在输入里而不改变输出。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:51:      仍沿用原题的稀疏布局和单色对象；额外信息只体现在箭头尾巴长度，不引入额外标记层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:59:def _detect_arrow(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:62:    \"\"\"Return ((dr,dc), start, max_bounces) for a 3/4/5-pixel arrow variant.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:85:    Trace diagonal rays from monochrome L-shaped arrows with encoded bounce budgets.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:90:    - Once the arrow has spent its encoded bounce budget, later side-touch walls are ignored\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:97:    arrow_cells: set[tuple[int, int]] = set()\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:98:    arrows: list[tuple[int, tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int], int]] = []\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/142ca369/D12/2/code.py:102:            info = _detect_arrow(pts)\n/home/lixinyu/sna