om 8 to 4 and both types must appear multiple times.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/2ba387bc/D5/4/code.py:65:   - Humans can see the rule from 2-4 examples because output becomes a narrow\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a25697e4/D14/0/code.py:7:# - Variant detail: 框架的两个子组件使用不同颜色（如上半蓝色、下半红色）。plug颜色需与'有notch的子组件'颜色匹配才能正确配对。增加颜色信息的利用维度。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/13/code.py:269:    - For every singleton color-1 marker, recolor the surrounding destination region to the original color of the lone source-side neighbor region.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/13/code.py:270:    - All recolorings happen simultaneously, so a source contributes its original region color even if that source is also repainted elsewhere.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D7/0/code.py:35:    - Tight crop can become visually invisible if anchors appear on both axis families, because border anchors pin the final bbox to multiple outer edges.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5dbc8537/D1/0/code.py:44:#    be decorative. We therefore require multiple duplicated size groups, and within\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5dbc8537/D1/0/code.py:80:#    groups with multiplicity >= 2 and with multiple cue colors inside that size\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3e6067c3/D5/3/code.py:47:    - \"The generator keeps multiple bridges per sample (path length >= 4), so the new rule repeats enough times for humans to spot it.\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/247ef758/D3/0/code.py:41:# - Markers remain color-coded and re-used across multiple targets, so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D11/0/code.py:13:    variant: plug is shown in a non-identity 90-degree multiple rotation and must be\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D11/0/code.py:21:    - Output is still the tight crop of the assembled shape with ctrl recolored to obj.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D11/0/code.py:34:      - then the old translation + recolor rule runs unchanged\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D11/0/code.py:72:    - No new color mapping is introduced; ctrl still disappears by recoloring to obj.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D4/2/code.py:13:#     - output still recolors ctrl -> obj and tight-crops the merged result\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D4/2/code.py:25:#     columns, the plug lands earlier; its connector can stay multiple rows above the base\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D7/2/code.py:70:#    channel/token identity, and stacking only changes multiplicity and placement.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a25697e4/D14/3/code.py:7:# - Variant detail: 不再是一个完整矩形+一个有缺口的，而是两个子组件各有一个notch，凹槽由两个notch对向组合形成更复杂的形状。增加凹槽形状的不规则性。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/39/code.py:15:#      near its upper-left and a colored tail stretching to the right/bottom. For TR with\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/39/code.py:55:#    - Non-TL input quadrants contain only one red square each. No quadrant contains multiple\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/23/code.py:7:#   Start from the base task's region recoloring. A T control still says \"repaint this\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/23/code.py:23:#   The base solver assumed marker cells should be recolored with the source-side final\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/23/code.py:37:#   the output is cropped around the recolored regions, and within that crop some\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/23/code.py:44:#   surrounding recolored areas even when the crop boundary cuts close to a marker.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/23/code.py:46:#   Every generated instance has at least one truly recolored destination region,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/23/code.py:142:    assert coords.size > 0, \"at least one region must be recolored\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/23/code.py:341: