 / owner component, then the L marker rotates the finished board: ┐ means 90 degrees counterclockwise and ┌ means 90 degrees clockwise.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D15/0/code.py:65:#      recolored to obj (4) after docking. No new color mapping logic is introduced.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D15/0/code.py:163:    - Stamp, recolor ctrl->obj, and tight-crop.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D7/2/code.py:21:#     to: \"Solve on the full canvas first, then crop to the narrow strip attached to the anchor edge.\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D7/2/code.py:27:#       - The sprites that will align to those anchors are already constrained to a narrow band next to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D7/2/code.py:44:#       - Difference: movement logic is unchanged; only the reported field of view is narrowed.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D7/2/code.py:46:#     - Mixed-edge anchors would make the crop ambiguous or force a union of multiple strips, which would\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a25697e4/D10/0/code.py:7:# - Variant detail: 输出仅保留对接后的框架+工具区域，裁剪掉所有多余背景。每个框架对接结果单独裁剪输出或整体紧凑裁剪。输出网格显著小于输入。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5dbc8537/D1/4/code.py:215:    \"\"\"Repeated-size multiplicities; every group size is 2 or 3.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/20/code.py:62:#       - \"top-left quadrant must contain a red anchor\": invalid, TL now has multiple colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/20/code.py:92:#     - Only TL contains multiple source objects; other quadrants still stay sparse.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/6/code.py:11:# - This combo changes the moment when destination color is chosen. Multiple Ts\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/6/code.py:74:#   on the two colored Ts, not from arbitrary recolor noise.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/6/code.py:404:    - A normal T votes to recolor the des