ple branches. The new\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b5033c1/27/code.py:66:#      no crowded region where multiple semantics stack on the same cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b5033c1/27/code.py:181:            raise ValueError(\"non-hub branch node has multiple forward neighbors\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/2d0172a1/D14/2/code.py:30:#       - old solver: row/col bands could produce a diagonal or L-shaped packing depending on bbox overlaps\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D14/1/code.py:50:#   sequence, re-used by multiple forks in the same grid.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D14/1/code.py:75:# - Multiple forks reuse palette colors, so a human can compare branch choices\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9bbf930d/D14/1/code.py:91:# - Assumption: if multiple turn options share the same best legend rank, the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/d35bdbdc/D15/1/code.py:151:      - border color appears multiple times\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/26/code.py:35:#   multiple visually revealing dents whose same-side 3x3 repair expands beyond\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/221dfab4/D8/2/code.py:43:#      includes multiple outlined blobs, the D8 change is directly visible rather than a rare side effect.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/221dfab4/D8/2/code.py:459:    tail = placements[2:]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/221dfab4/D8/2/code.py:460:    rng.shuffle(tail)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/221dfab4/D8/2/code.py:461:    placements[2:] = tail\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/2d0172a1/D10/1/code.py:38:#     the variant is intentionally narrow: only output shape changes\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D12/0/code.py:57:#    preserving the square canvas. The generator requires multiple trimmed sides and a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/31/code.py:49:#   belong to the same object and must not create multiple overlapping patches.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ce