    gr, gc, av, bv = details[0]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D2/0/code.py:22:#       into the narrow side column. In this variant, adjacent corner-style exits are dead:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D2/0/code.py:49:#     - Therefore the variant redefines horizontal reachability narrowly: the drop column must\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D2/0/code.py:95:    shafts plus longer flat shelves, so narrow step chutes no longer connect basins.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/24/code.py:44:#    - The new freedom is deliberately narrow. Irregularity is only 0/1 jitter on one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:25:# - D11/0 multiplies ownership: one '+' now carries 2-4 separate seeds on different\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:40:#   multiple attached seeds visibly intentional rather than looking like duplicates.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:47:#   separate 4-connected component. With multiple rays per plus, the generator must now\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:49:# - The `adj_ids` collection loop already supports multiple marker components touching one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:53:# - The nozzle-alignment checks assume the seed span matches the arm-tip span exactly.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:65:#   multiple seeds visibly hang off the same plus, and none of them is already expanded.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:71:#   attachments. The input is even cleaner because every ray tail is erased back to bg.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:78:#   2. each plus has multiple adjacent marker components.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:79:# - Because seeds remain small and aligned to arm tips, the solver can infer the same\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code