earnable instead of exploding into\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d59b0160/29/code.py:46:#    - Pattern matching becomes ambiguous if a target color appears multiple times. The new solver\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D2/1/code.py:49:#    old clockwise interpretation on the exact same input by multiple pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D10/2/code.py:41:#     visible_difference: a single line now contains multiple colored beat segments instead of one global fill\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D10/2/code.py:43:#     - multiple companions are allowed but capped at 3 so the rule stays visible in 2-4 examples\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/16de56c4/D10/2/code.py:145:            f\"Line {li} ({'row' if by_row else 'col'}) has multiple repeating colors: \"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b7bacbf/D2/1/code.py:26:#         - multiple leaves extend into different interior regions\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b7bacbf/D2/1/code.py:27:#         - loops can be attached on different branches, so multiple separated cavities fill\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b7bacbf/D2/1/code.py:91:#     - loops are attached to multiple different limbs, so the output shows several separated\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b7bacbf/D2/1/code.py:447:def _extend_tip_path_inplace(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b7bacbf/D2/1/code.py:451:    tip: tuple[int, int],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b7bacbf/D2/1/code.py:457:    cur = tip\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b7bacbf/D2/1/code.py:459:    dr_bias, dc_bias = _bias_for(tip, h, w, rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b7bacbf/D2/1/code.py:527:                _extend_tip_path_inplace(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8b7bacbf/D2/1/code.py:563:    trunk_path.extend(_extend_tip_path_inplace(canvas, tree_set, degrees, first_rc, trunk_target - 1, line_col, rng))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D9/1/code.py:70:# - Human-visible difference from the orig