ape cue remains visible at multiple scales.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8e5c0c38/D2/3/code.py:50:    - Objects remain in separated regions, so no area contains multiple unrelated structures layered together.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/c7f57c3e/D1/1/code.py:35:#     not_too_simple: \"each size group appears multiple times, preventing a lone outlier from making the rule ambiguous\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/c7f57c3e/D1/1/code.py:49:#       - \"large bbox dimensions are integer multiples of small bbox dimensions\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/c7f57c3e/D1/1/code.py:131:    assert len(comps) >= 4, \"grid must contain multiple sprites from both size groups\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/7/code.py:41:#      inferred rule from multiple examples.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/7/code.py:68:#      is therefore a strong, visible consequence rather than a subtle detail.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/17/code.py:34:   - Marker geometry is also narrow: a short 1xk or kx1 segment outside the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d59b0160/28/code.py:31:     1. The legend is still a compact square with an L-shaped border, but it is pasted on\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d59b0160/28/code.py:96:   - The generator uses all four edges, multiple border colors, and all four interior sizes\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/21/code.py:24:#      Blue and green always repeat, so the batch rule is visually supported by multiple\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/581f7754/D15/2/code.py:25:#    - Keep 1-3 anchor colors and 3-5 sprites so multiple components still reuse the same anchor color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D20/0/code.py:28:#    - The change is intentionally narrow: only D20 changes. Water motion,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D20/0/code.py:34:#    - Samples are rejected unless the output contains multiple wet pixels. This\n/home/lixiny