irections \"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/2/code.py:308:    - The mirrored outbound-and-return route is encoded globally across frames, but each local move is still determined by the triangle tip and the unique aligned marker direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/2/code.py:437:    multiples = [n for n in range(*STEPS_RANGE) if n % n_frames == 0]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/2/code.py:438:    weights = np.array([(n**3) / (_STEP_AVAILABILITY[n] ** 2) for n in multiples], dtype=float)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D11/2/code.py:440:    n_steps = int(rng.choice(multiples, p=weights))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/5/code.py:36:#    - Reusing only two seed colors across multiple seeds gives enough repeated support in 2-4 examples.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/31f7f899/D13/0/code.py:52:#    output. The lower tails vary independently and visibly remain attached to the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/12/code.py:32:#    - \"The dst is the one with more hole area\" is broken; there are multiple empty-hole\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/12/code.py:47:#      cavity groups, that multiple dst frames each mirror one of those groups, and that the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/800d221b/D19/2/code.py:8:# - Variant detail: 路径中间有一个非P色的标记像素，该标记颜色指示整条分支应着的颜色（覆盖邻接种子规则）。解题者需要识别路径内嵌的指令。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D4/2/code.py:28:#   multiple outer components and their roles.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D4/2/code.py:61:#   the interior, while the L-shaped completion from another object clearly terminates\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/28/code.py:44:#      majority-colored branch. The same two seed colors recur across multiple seeds, which gives enough repeated\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/800d221b/D2/0/code.py:8:# - Variant detail: 取反：hub中心像素取与hub边界相邻重着色分支中出现最少的颜色。解题者需要计数后取最小值而非最大值，改变推理方向。\n/home/