aped Manhattan path.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/3/code.py:39:    - When multiple cues are present, the generator mixes at least one vertical and one horizontal cue\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/3/code.py:401:    - when multiple cues exist, at least one horizontal cue also exists\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/800d221b/D2/3/code.py:8:# - Variant detail: hub中心不按相邻分支像素计数，而是按与hub连接的种子区域个数投票——哪种颜色连接了更多种子区域就选哪种。解题者需要计数种子而非像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/31f7f899/D6/3/code.py:46:# The change is kept narrowly on D6:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/31f7f899/D6/3/code.py:81:# implementation detail.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/31f7f899/D6/3/code.py:97:        # multiple candidates, prefer the one closest to the prescribed middle row.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/18/code.py:544:    \"\"\"Build L-shaped arm waypoints for _path_crossing_all / _path_through.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/3/code.py:30:#   or column, not only in front of the tip\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/3/code.py:60:    Input is multiple frames concatenated horizontally, separated by full-height\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/3/code.py:180:        f\"head={head} dir={d}: markers reachable on multiple axes \"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/3/code.py:244:    Key insight: the tip still tells you the current orientation, but orientation no longer restricts which marker can be chosen; the deciding cue is which axis contains the remaining aligned markers.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/3/code.py:331:    multiples = [n for n in range(*STEPS_RANGE) if n % n_frames == 0]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/3/code.py:332:    weights = np.array([(n**3) / (_STEP_AVAILABILITY[n] ** 2) for n in multiples], dtype=float)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D1/3/code.py:334:    n_steps = int(rng.choice(multiples, p=weights))\n/home/lixinyu/sn