nd colors form short 8-connected line segments, each\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/36/code.py:31:#    - Every non-background color still appears multiple times in the input, so the two-stage regrouping\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/36/code.py:300:    - The puzzle is no longer solved in one placement pass: color first tells which scraps belong together, then color semantics narrow the vertical band, and finally the ordered row layout resolves which same-band chamber each assembled subcomponent occupies.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/30/code.py:220:      hide multiple seed-defined objects; some merged solids jointly surround a cavity.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/14/code.py:40:#   matching key, with 8-connected hole filling as the topological detail needed to read\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7666fa5d/3/code.py:27:# - The new observable rule is therefore structural, not numeric: \"yellow-tipped anti-diagonal chains are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/37/code.py:31:#    period (AABB). This keeps the rule rich enough to be seen but narrow enough\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/37/code.py:158:    tip_12 = [flag for _, flag in out_info]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/37/code.py:167:        \"tip_12\": tip_12,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/37/code.py:318:    for ep, d, is_12 in zip(active[\"endpoints\"], active[\"out_dirs\"], active[\"tip_12\"]):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/37/code.py:467:def _make_arm(depth, start_v, target_v, extra_steps, tip_12=False):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/37/code.py:472:        if tip_12:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/37/code.py:534:    tip_12 = depth >= 2 * max_n_side and random.random() < TIP_12_PROB\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/37/code.py:535:    left = _make_arm(depth, 0, left_bottom, extra_l,