ow_cells\"]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/15/code.py:621:        p, q = pair[\"tips\"]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/15/code.py:632:        p_cells, q_cells = pair[\"arrow_cells\"]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:8:#    - 保留原题对象家族：背景 0；每个箭头仍是 2x2 外接框里缺一角的 3 像素 L 形。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:35:#    - 每个生成样例固定 3 个箭头、总反射 5 次，其中前 4 次强制覆盖：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:53:#    - generator 继续 output-first：先规划每条正交折线路径和每次镜面反射，再反推出输入中的 L 箭头和\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:57:#    - 箭头、镜面、输出轨迹三者互不重叠；同色镜面之间还额外禁止 8 邻接，避免被 8 连通检测并成一个\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:69:#    - 保持 18-20 的稀疏方阵、固定 3 个箭头，减少拥挤。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:71:#    - 颜色角色分层明确：箭头初色来自非镜面色；镜面只用 7/8；反射后轨迹直接变成对应镜面色，肉眼能\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:91:#    - 假设 1：箭头仍是孤立的单色 3 像素 L 形。generator 保证箭头互不重叠，且箭头色不与镜面色复用。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:95:#    - 假设 5：路径不会穿过其他箭头、镜面或已规划轨迹，也不会在网格内形成死循环。generator 用占用检查、\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:164:def _is_arrow_pts(pts: list[Coord]) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:172:def _arrow_dir_and_start(pts: list[Coord]) -> tuple[Direction, Coord] | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:202:def _arrow_points_from_start(sr: int, sc: int, direction: Direction) -> list[Coord]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:237:    arrow_cells: set[Coord] = set()\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:238:    arrows: list[tuple[int, list[Coord]]] = []\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:242:            if _is_arrow_pts(pts):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:243:                arrows.append((int(col), pts))\n/home