t_pts}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:379:            cur_col = int(arrow_color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:417:                    ray_cells.append((int(nr), int(nc), _periodic_color(int(arrow_color), int(cur_col), int(phase))))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:496:            for r, c in arrow_pts:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:497:                grid[r, c] = out[r, c] = int(arrow_color)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dbff022c/20/code.py:38:#   narrow, which guarantees a visible disagreement between pixel-majority and side-vote\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/34/code.py:21:#      bar's top side, drops past the bar tip, then returns on a second vertical lane to close at the top.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/34/code.py:42:#      closes back on itself and creates a boxed spiral lobe around the obstacle tip.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/34/code.py:214:      bypass: top cap -> inward drop -> descent past the bar tip -> outward return -> closure at the top.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/19/code.py:57:#       keep only records where the crop alone has multiple matches\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/19/code.py:218:    - Because the crop is intentionally too small, multiple matches can exist; keep only the matches whose\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/4/code.py:56:- The original horizontal transfer used a center shift that happened to be safe for one common shape. With multiple\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/4/code.py:108:- Multiple red lanes are processed left-to-right because marker bars are sorted by column before transfer; the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/4/code.py:202:    - If multiple red lanes feed the same destination, their batches are inserted in left-to-right source order. All marker bars are then erased back to the background.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/8/code.py:268:    Paint the extension side using an L-shaped path and decreasing intervals.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b80bb43/11/code.py:33:#      plus diagonal chain {(7,9),(6,8)} becomes just the 3-pixel vertical twig\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b80bb43/11/code.py:36:#      from the unused diagonal component, deletes the twig tip, then the new\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b80bb43/11/code.py:37:#      tip, then the last pixel.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:7:#   task: Identify a dihedral 20x20 motif placement from a masked L-shaped crop,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:8:#     then output the point-reflected L-shaped partner region instead of the full motif.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:16:#         sub-rectangle is replaced by a third mask color, leaving an L-shaped\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:20:#       output_content: the point-reflected counterpart of the input L-shaped region\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:40:#     - the fusion requires both at once: infer placement from an L-shaped sample,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:45:#     with ordinary background and the L shape would be invisible.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:227:    Match a masked L-shaped motif crop and return the point-reflected L-shaped partner window.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:231:    - Two colors belong to the motif itself, while the third color fills one corner sub-rectangle so that only an L-shaped subset of the crop is visible.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:239:    - The masked corner tells you both which cells to ignore during recognition and how the non-rectangular viewport itself must move under center reflection, so solving the task means reflecting the entire L-shaped viewing region, not merely the visible pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/4/code.py:268:    then validates that the fused solver reconstructs the intended reflected L-shaped output.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:3:# Name: 单箭头+高反射次数\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:22:#   - 保留原题对象词汇：3 像素 L 形箭头、单色墙像素/短线段、沿对角线行进且会继承墙色的射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:23:#   - D11/0 把“1-14 个独立箭头”收缩成“固定 1 个箭头”，所以推理重心不再是管理多源，而是深追踪一条路径。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:28:#   - 例：箭头右角源点在 (10,3)，朝右下发射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:29:#   - 原题常见情况：第一段走几步后遇到墙，只反射 0-4 次，总体是短折线；如果有多个箭头，人眼还要先分辨每条线是谁发出的。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:30:#   - 本融合版：同一个箭头会连续命中 5-10 个侧墙。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:37:#   - 只保留 1 个箭头，避免多箭头叠加后高反射路径变得不可读。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:41:#   - 原 `for start_col, pts in arrows` 默认多箭头很常见；融合后生成器保证只有 1 个箭头，但 solver 仍兼容多箭头输入。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:47:#   - 箭头、射线路径、墙像素三者必须严格不重叠，且全部在边界内。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:49:#   - 生成器在构造后再次跑箭头检测，确保没有墙组件伪装成第二个 L 形箭头。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:51:#   - 输入里只有一个显眼的 L 形箭头和许多分散墙标记；输出里是一条长锯齿彩色路径，视觉上和原题的多短线明显不同。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:59:#   - solver 仍假设箭头可由单色 3 像素 L 形分量检测到。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:60:#     generator guard: 墙不与箭头同色，且提交前检查检测结果恰好只有 1 个箭头。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:61:#   - solver 对输入没有“必须单箭头”硬编码，但本组合的行为依赖单箭头。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:62:#     generator guard: 每个生成样例严格只放 1 个箭头。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca36