he narrowing; it stops noticeably earlier, roughly halfway along the usable route.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:58:#    - The taper is axis-aligned and isolated on the tail, avoiding noisy overlaps with the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:60:#    - Width expansion is capped at a small extra band, so the tail looks like a clean funnel\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:231:    - The tail can gradually taper as it approaches the destination.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:379:def _tail_clear(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:407:def _pick_tail_plan(grid: np.ndarray, pr: int, pc: int, n: int, reached: bool) -> dict | None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:448:                if not _tail_clear(grid, pr, pc, n, direction, side, extra):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:478:def _paint_tapered_tail(grid: np.ndarray, pr: int, pc: int, n: int, plan: dict) -> tuple[int, int]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:621:    tail_r, tail_c = pixel_pos[-1]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:622:    plan = _pick_tail_plan(grid, tail_r, tail_c, n, reached)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/25/code.py:625:    dest_r, dest_c = _paint_tapered_tail(grid, tail_r, tail_c, n, plan)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/4/code.py:47:  - a later horizontal gate may narrow to height 2, so it still passes\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/4/code.py:48:  - the final horizontal gate may narrow to height 1, so the 2-high token stops\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/4/code.py:52:  - multiple gates matter in sequence, not just one choke point\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/4/code.py:53:  - horizontal and vertical narrowings test different rectangle dimensions\n/home/lixinyu/